  "meta": {
    "title": "Dormitory",
    "description": "The first content scene (PROP_PIPELINE_PLAN \u00a78): a 14x9 GU dormitory built entirely from voxel models (bed_single, nightstand, locker, bookshelf, desk, chair, bin; ours, `tools/asset_generation/gen_dorm_vox.py`) in slots. Four beds with their nightstands along the top wall, a locker row on the right, a bookshelf on the left, two desks with chairs, two bins, one door at the bottom. It is also the CALIBRATION room: every object at its real size beside a wall and the agent, to judge sizes, palette and material numbers in one place (PROPS_TIER4_PLAN P7). Every prop is a destructible store container: blast, shoot and burn it."
  },
